Q(13,1,1,"If the engine seizes, you should","Squeeze the clutch to disconnect the engine and pull off the road",["Open the throttle", "Shift up", "Brake with the rear only"],"Squeezing the clutch frees the rear wheel so you can coast to a safe stop.");
F(13,1,"If the engine seizes, you should","Squeeze the clutch to disconnect the engine and pull off the road. Squeezing the clutch frees the rear wheel so you can coast to a safe stop.");
Q(13,2,1,"If something hits your face shield or you get an insect in your eye, you should","Keep your eyes on the road and your hands on the bars, then pull over when it is safe",["Wipe it off at once with both hands", "Brake hard immediately", "Close both eyes"],"Stay in control first. Fix the problem after you have stopped safely.");
F(13,2,"If something hits your face shield or you get an insect in your eye, you should","Keep your eyes on the road and your hands on the bars, then pull over when it is safe. Stay in control first. Fix the problem after you have stopped safely.");
Q(13,1,1,"A load should be carried","Low and forward, over or ahead of the rear axle",["High on a sissy bar", "Behind the rear axle only", "On the handlebars"],"Weight carried high or far back upsets the balance and can cause a wobble.");
