Q(13,1,1,"In a staggered group formation, the second rider follows the leader by about","One second, in the other side of the lane",["Three seconds, directly behind", "Half a second, directly behind", "Ten seconds"],"The stagger keeps riders close but gives each a two-second gap behind the rider directly ahead.");
