Q(13,1,1,"Before you ride an unfamiliar motorcycle, you should","Find and try all the controls and ride more cautiously at first",["Ride it at highway speed right away", "Remove the mirrors", "Ignore the owner's manual"],"Many crashes happen on a motorcycle the rider has had for less than six months.");
