Q(13,1,1,"If your group is larger than four or five riders, you should","Divide it into two or more smaller groups",["Ride side by side to save space", "Close up to half a second apart", "Use both lanes"],"Small groups are easier and safer for other traffic to pass and are less likely to be separated.");
