Q(13,1,1,"In California, a motorcycle rider under 21 must do what before getting a motorcycle license?","Complete the California Motorcyclist Safety Program training course",["Nothing extra", "Own a motorcycle for a year", "Pass a commercial license test"],"The handbook states the training course is required for riders under 21 years old.");
